OL,3,GNEWSAReform could try to remove Senedd
OL,4,Apresiding officer over member's
OL,5,Aspeaking ban
OL,6,
OL,7,FA senior Reform politician says a
OL,8,Fno-confidence vote in the Senedd's
OL,9,Fpresiding officer is "not off the
OL,10,Ftable", after a party member was banned
OL,11,Ffor claiming white people are being
OL,12,F"replaced".
OL,14,FLlE7r Powell, Reform's chief whip in
OL,15,FCardiff Bay, said his colleague Joe
OL,16,FMartin had the right to raise
OL,17,F"legitimate concerns" that were being
OL,18,F"infringed upon".
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
