OL,3,GNEWSAReform could try to remove Senedd
OL,4,Apresiding officer over member's
OL,5,Aspeaking ban
OL,6,
OL,7,FMartin was told he would not be called
OL,8,Fto speak in the Welsh Parliament until
OL,9,Fhe apologised for the remarks made on
OL,10,FTuesday, which Presiding Officer Huw
OL,11,FIrranca-Davies called "unnecessarily
OL,12,Fprovocative and deliberately
OL,13,Foffensive".
OL,15,FReform withdrew from most Senedd
OL,16,Fproceedings on Wednesday in response.
